>> a := Lethathamo ← Ntho ; Nnete ; Leshano ; Bulione ; 1 ; Palo ; ['Str'] ; Mongolo ; { ['Empty']. }.
Sephetho ngola: (a palo-ea-lintho), mola-o-mocha.
{ :i
	Sephetho ngola: 
	['a '] + 
	((a ? i) mofuta) +
	([' \‘this\’ '] this: (a ? i))  +
	[' is '] +
	(((a ? i) Letho?) ena: [''] kapa-eane: ['NOT']) + 
	[' Nil.'],
	mola-o-mocha.
} × (a palo-ea-lintho).
Sephetho ngola: ['but.. Nil is.. '] + ((Letho Letho?) ena: ['certainly NIL!'] kapa-eane: ['not NIL??']), mola-o-mocha.